1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,500
What if you became Thor, but without the hammer?

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:03,980
You'd think you lost your power.

3
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,560
But in the movies, the hammer was never the power.

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:07,220
So what is?

5
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:07,920
You are.

6
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:12,060
In Ragnarok, Thor loses his hammer and still calls down lightning on his own.

7
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,500
So you've still got lightning.

8
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:17,980
And real lightning can heat the air to about five times hotter than the surface of the Sun.

9
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,040
The bad news?

10
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:20,340
The hammer was your ride.

11
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,660
No hammer, no flying.

12
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:23,680
The god of thunder now takes the bus.

13
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,020
And the dark part.

14
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,580
Every time you get angry, lightning comes out.

15
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:28,380
Your phone fries.

16
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,580
Your laptop fries.

17
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:30,830
Your neighbor's Wi-Fi?

18
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:31,400
Gone.

19
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,320
Send this to the friend who'd want Thor's powers.

20
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,980
Ask them how they'd charge their phone.

21
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:35,680
Want to see more?

22
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:38,560
Subscribe, quickly, before I sneeze and fry your phone.
